&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Footnotes&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-825096-1&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;1&lt;/a&gt;. Provolone and American cheese are available as well, and these can be ordered following the same guideline by substituting &amp;quot;whiz.&amp;quot;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;footnote-footer&quot; id=&quot;footnote-825096-2&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;  &gt;2&lt;/a&gt;. A rival cheesesteak shop across the street from Geno&#039;s Steaks.&lt;/div&gt;
