 <p>Senior Agent: Alright, Mr. █████. Now tell me, what happened in your approach to said Anomaly?</p> <p>&quot;Death&quot;: While approaching the entity, █████ died. We fired up almost all of our bullets, it did almost nothing to it.</p> <p>Senior Agent: I see, and what did the Anomaly look like? What were it characteristics?</p> <p>&quot;Death&quot;: It looked humanoid, genderless, and having no clothes and genitalia. It bled, but not for long. It recovers from bullet wounds as if it was nothing.</p> <p>Senior Agent: Alright, that's all I needed to know. Thank you for your time.</p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7031295&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605794330" alt="Alexei Molkov" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7031295)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov" >Alexei Molkov</a></span></p> 
