					<![CDATA[
						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>Item #:</strong> SCP-5156</p> <p><strong>Object Class:</strong> Euclid, Potential Keter.</p> <p><strong>Special Containment Procedures:</strong> SCP-5156 is to be kept at a 16x16 white room exactly 3 feet above the ground and 4 bulletproof glasses, 1 for each corner (This helps said SCP stay sane by seeing employees through glass). With a gas pipe filled with nerve gas for control usage.</p> <p><strong>Description:</strong> SCP-5156 is a mutated virus that came from an unknown planet. It's appearance is a genderless Humanoid-shaped figure that has arms twirling uncontrollably every second for an odd reason. SCP-5156's capabilities are yet to be understood, but the one discovered is regeneration. SCP-5156's regeneration from wounds and such is absurd, it has come to a point where SCP-5156 can regenerate a limb for approximately 3 seconds. Sightings of SCP-5156 have been spotted in ██████. Thankfully, only a handful of people saw it. Further research of SCP-5156 is ordered by the 05 Council. Reports and Investigation will be available to those of Level 4+ Clearance.</p> <p><strong>Investigations:</strong></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5156-investigation-001">SCP-5156 Investigation 001</a></p> <p><strong>Research Logs:</strong></p> <p><a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5156-research-log-001">SCP-5156 Research Log 001</a></p> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=7031295&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1605794330" alt="Alexei Molkov" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=7031295)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/alexei-molkov" >Alexei Molkov</a></span></p> 
